  m_text: 'Here''s some general information to know:



    You can end a Trial early
    by clicking and holding either one of your face buttons on

    your controllers
    for an amount of time to end a Trial early.


    This time by default is 3 seconds
    but it can be modified inside of the mod''s config.'
