      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Types of trials:


    There are 2 different types of trials you can play
    currently, box and zone trials.


    Box trials are trials that require you
    to collect all of the "boxes" that appear in

    order to complete the trial.


    Zone
    trials are trials that don''''t have any predetermined route, and just require

    you
    to go from one place to another, no matter how you want to.'
