      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Trial Rules:


    1. No cheating, like, at all.


    2. No switching
    FPS under 60hz


    3. You cannot use any extreme predictions, some predictions
    are inevitable, but

    keep it low please.


    4. You may not have an innopropriate
    name, so no names that contain profanity,

    slurs, etc, also try to keep any
    politics out of your name.


    Any violations of these rules may result in
    a ban from the mod forever with

    no appeal.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b8ada593e69c06a4da9cd8516868460a, type: 2}
